All of our meetings, competitions and other important dates are on this calendar. Use the **+ Google Calendar** button at the bottom of the calendar to add our events to your own calendar.

**Before Kickoff (early January):** Wednesdays, 6–8 PM. **After Kickoff:** Mondays, Wednesdays and Fridays, 4–8 PM. We meet in the BHS 100 Building, Room 103.
